### Alimentation (supply situation) — same payload returned for both mock PRMs.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/alimentation_auto/v1/99999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

### Alimentation — three-phase mock PRM.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/alimentation_auto/v1/11111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

### Alimentation — unknown PRM. Expect the ITC error payload.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/alimentation_auto/v1/12345678901234
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}
